# Contexto = raíz del repo. Se usa con: docker build -f frontend/Dockerfile .
# Lista blanca: todo afuera salvo el frontend (así nunca entra un .env ni el backend).
*
!frontend/
frontend/node_modules
frontend/.next
frontend/reports
frontend/evidence
frontend/test-results
frontend/playwright-report
frontend/.features-gen
frontend/.stryker-tmp
frontend/.lighthouseci
frontend/tests
frontend/**/*.test.ts
frontend/**/*.test.tsx
frontend/.env*
frontend/*.tsbuildinfo
frontend/next-env.d.ts
